TT_forkbump
Affects how quickly the fork compresses. More clicks = softer (quicker)
TT_forkrebound
Affects how quickly the fork extends. More clicks = softer (quicker)
TT_preload
Increase preload to stiffen the suspension and reduce sag
TT_shockbump
Affects how quickly the suspension compresses. More clicks = softer (quicker)
TT_shockrebound
Affects how quickly the suspension extends. More clicks = softer (quicker)
TT_shockfastbump
Affects how quickly the suspension compresses on hard landings. More turns = softer (quicker)
TT_forkoil
Decreasing the fork oil measurement increases the spring stiffness in the last part of fork travel
